        "evidence_id": "E001",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Appeal from an order of the Supreme Court, Genesee County (Emilio L. Colaiacovo, J.), entered April 5, 2018. The order, insofar as appealed from, denied the motion of defendant Pyramid Walden Company, L.P., for summary judgment dismissing the amended complaint against it.",
